    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Subclass of HTMLParser that announces parse events, without doing
anything else.

You can use this to get a picture of how html.parser sees a given
document. The easiest way to do this is to call `htmlparser_trace`.
</verbatim> </para>
